{"version":1,"key":"card:32","content":{"id":32,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d2a9df5e-243e-432e-baeb-ccb78424ac00","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"意志力不是由心灵力量控制，而是由大脑控制，在英国有个工人，工人的意志力很好，有一次事故，前额皮质受到了损坏，虽然得以康复，但是性情大变，易怒易躁，这说明是大脑在控制你的意志力。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ae8828d5-0fa4-421e-896d-e58581a30b33","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"意志力会受到哪些因素影响："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"b3915f00-6163-42f2-885b-f5b26a251784","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"95b7fce8-71d0-46bd-bc0e-3bbc9f3693f9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7c087010-fa24-43cf-a220-d13865ac9bfc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"身体极限"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"23ccc4f2-6a2f-4268-9b9c-436e7d3425e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当身体来到极限时，大脑的能量不足，各项功能受到限制，从而使得意志力下降"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"30669e47-68fc-4ec7-bf96-6e997954c8b7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cc4be0ec-2497-4b27-95a0-088ae2cea839","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"道德许可"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dda98b78-ec65-4f98-ace1-d3e8cdb6cdd4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在做出阶段性成果时，我们会允许自己是做一些破坏意志力的事情，比如买买买，吃吃吃，并且觉得这没有什么不对，是自己对自己的一种奖励"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db3